  "releaseNotes": "v3.2.1 stable: dependency-metadata fix only - no code changes. Bumps `SpawnDev.RTC` PackageReference from 1.1.6 to 1.1.7 to inherit RTC's clean `SpawnDev.MultiMedia 0.2.0` stable dep (was previously transitively pulling `SpawnDev.MultiMedia 0.2.0-rc.1` through RTC, triggering NU1603 on consumers without local-feed access). Closes the deploy-blocker for downstream Blazor projects with strict warning-as-error policies.",
